PathoROB
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2025, BIFOLD Pathomics
Licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License.
Source: https://github.com/bifold-pathomics/PathoROB

croma vendors the Average Performance Drop (APD) reduction from PathoROB verbatim,
in src/croma/downstream/_pathorob.py, where the full BSD 3-Clause text — copyright
notice, conditions and disclaimer — is retained. croma reports APD as the faithful
PathoROB reference, which requires running PathoROB's own reduction rather than a
re-derivation of it; the code is vendored rather than depended on because PathoROB
is not published on PyPI and PyPI rejects direct-URL dependencies.

The vendored code is frozen: upstream changes deliberately do not propagate, because
these functions are the frozen definition of the reference metric. See
docs/adr/0011-downstream-shortcut-susceptibility-ships-in-the-library.md.

